  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2804.11 Limitation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2804.11 Limitation. Petitions for review shall be limited to one from the law enforcement officer and one from the person whose license has been suspended or revoked, per administrative review or hearing.\n\nSource. #8782-A, eff 1-1-07 (formerly Saf-C 2804.083); ss by #10888, eff 7-16-15",
